items/thm-mean-value-inequality.md-69-[L2] Cauchy-Schwarz: $|\langle u,w\rangle| \le \lVert u\rVert_2\lVert w\rVert_2$, and $t \le |t|$ ([[thm-cauchy-schwarz-and-the-euclidean-norm]], [[lem-of-abs-value]]); $\lVert w\rVert_2 \ge 0$, and $\lVert w\rVert_2 = 0$ exactly when $w = 0$ ([[def-norm-and-normed-space]]).
items/thm-mean-value-inequality.md-70-
